      <link>https://www.blackbird-watchmanual.com/manual/intelligence/the-worlds-smallest-movement-jaeger-lecoultre-calibre-101/</link>
      <description>Jaeger-LeCoultre's Calibre 101 holds the world's smallest mechanical movement record for 94 years. Still in production today, refined yet dimensionally unchanged, it continues to beat at 21,600 vph with a 33-hour reserve.</description>
