      <link>https://www.blackbird-watchmanual.com/manual/modern/when-time-suspended/</link>
      <description>The Hermès Arceau Le Temps Suspendu is a technically whimsical watch with a unique philosophical premise: the ability to pause time. With a press of a button, the hour and minute hands retract to a neutral position and the date is hidden, creating a "suspended" moment.</description>
